    GROQ -->|Extracted Entities: Name, Budget, Location, Intent, Timeline| BE

    BE -->|Generate Call Summary and Qualification Notes| SUM[Call Summaries & Notes]
    BE -->|Persist Leads + Summaries| DB[(SQLite Database)]

    FE -->|GET /leads<br/>GET /leads/:id| BE
    BE -->|JSON Lead Records + Summaries| FE

    subgraph ClientLayer[Client Layer]
